{"env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "height": 30, "title": "The live demo's host", "version": 2, "width": 110}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1;33m# edge-mesh / k8s-lan-party v0.2.0 - end-to-end run with a real visitor on AWS (2026-11-03)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.4, "o", "\u001b[1;33m# Visitor: a fresh EC2 t3.small (Ubuntu 24.04, eu-west-1, free tier), nothing open inbound, main 2be78d6 of the public repo.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.8, "o", "\u001b[1;33m# Host: the live demo (control plane at home, lighthouse + page on a VPS), auto admission ON, 2 places of 1 h, panic OFF.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.2, "o", "\u001b[1;33m# Real IPs, claim code and token ids are masked.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.6, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.0, "o", "\u001b[1;33m# Timeline (UTC):  request 16:49:35 -> approved (auto) 16:50:30 (55 s) -> bundle collected 16:51:35 -> joined 16:51:57 -> Ready 16:52:05 (host)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.4, "o", "\u001b[1;33m#                  -> warning 17:45:30 (5 min left) -> lease ended and node expelled 17:50:30 (by the tick, how=expired)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.8, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.8, "o", "\u001b[2m   ... 3 min 6 s later\u001b[0m\r\n"]
